    "en": "Your moods are steadier, and you are spared much of the private pain others in this pattern carry.",
    "limit": "原文「必須巨門化權，或會科權吉化然後始主情緒穩定」；「會科權吉化」部分涉待決 B16（天同化祿之年天機化權必會照），未寫。",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "wtz.deep.p346.b002",
        "sha256": "553b855fdc2d6be13444d045e511341221c536426f0f5f0366e8a133d6332c5a"
